{"4414490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RavenStar", "steam_appid": 4414490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RavenStar is a mini-metroidvania focused on precise platforming, secrets to find, and a heartfelt narrative.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a raven born without wings. Cast out of your village, you must find a way to return home. Explore hidden areas, survive your inner-demons, and gain new abilities by making new friendships in a lonely world. Only then will you reach the legendary Wishing Star that may finally send you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore An Interconnected World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, glide, and sprint across a beautiful world teeming with secrets and new friends to discover. Several areas combine to create one large interconnected region to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/218c7f77150dbadd3b76a658cf154668.poster.avif?t=1774928449\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/218c7f77150dbadd3b76a658cf154668.webm?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/218c7f77150dbadd3b76a658cf154668.mp4?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Charming New Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend fun characters to gain new customization options, traveling companions, and abilities to explore the world. Every friendship you make unlocks something new!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/6bf16f90e6d5e78b28ca91e91f1c73b6.poster.avif?t=1774928449\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/6bf16f90e6d5e78b28ca91e91f1c73b6.webm?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/6bf16f90e6d5e78b28ca91e91f1c73b6.mp4?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overcome Your Shadows</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape danger as shadows from your past return to haunt you. Use the abilities you've gained to overcome your inner-demons and personal struggles. Will you  return home, or will you deny your upbringing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/f5555257afe6a66fdb9469334353d36f.poster.avif?t=1774928449\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/f5555257afe6a66fdb9469334353d36f.webm?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/f5555257afe6a66fdb9469334353d36f.mp4?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RavenStar is a mini-metroidvania focused on precise platforming, secrets to find, and a heartfelt narrative.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a raven born without wings. Cast out of your village, you must find a way to return home. Explore hidden areas, survive your inner-demons, and gain new abilities by making new friendships in a lonely world. Only then will you reach the legendary Wishing Star that may finally send you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore An Interconnected World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, glide, and sprint across a beautiful world teeming with secrets and new friends to discover. Several areas combine to create one large interconnected region to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/218c7f77150dbadd3b76a658cf154668.poster.avif?t=1774928449\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/218c7f77150dbadd3b76a658cf154668.webm?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/218c7f77150dbadd3b76a658cf154668.mp4?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Charming New Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend fun characters to gain new customization options, traveling companions, and abilities to explore the world. Every friendship you make unlocks something new!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/6bf16f90e6d5e78b28ca91e91f1c73b6.poster.avif?t=1774928449\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/6bf16f90e6d5e78b28ca91e91f1c73b6.webm?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4414490/extras/6bf16f90e6d5e78b28ca91e91f1c73b6.mp4?t=1774928449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\